L001669	\begin{lemma} \label{lem:coeff}
L001670	    Here $E=e^{i\theta}\sum_{j=1}^{m} a_jQ_j,Q_j\in\mathcal P_N$, where $m=\mathrm{poly}(N)$ is the number of error terms, each coefficient $a_j$ is real and satisfies $|a_i|=\Theta(1)$. Then when $N$ is large
